---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator or projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_not_ended: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_not_ended --> q_set_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_not_ended --> q_revert: revert AlreadyEnded
    q_set_ended --> q_set_times: hasEnded = true, endTime = block.timestamp
    q_set_times --> [*]: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds, emit SaleEnded
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_set_ended
        INV-001: ending is irreversible
        INV-002: refund period starts at moment of ending
        INV-003: both Legion operators and projectAdmin can end sale
    end note
